{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/792872-plain-stupid-plots","id":792872,"title":"Plain stupid Plots","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-25T16:57:49-08:00","id":792872,"title":"Plain stupid Plots","content":"We all went there, weren't we? Either because we rushed a plot together, things weren't as brilliant as we originally thought or we just decided to have a laugh at the players. Every GM once did some really stupid plot. Scions no exception. In fact, I have found Scion to promote these plots, maybe because of how it handles gods. Some of them chose.. odd forms to appear in to say the least and the fact that Fate likes repetition means that sometimes things have to be reimagined in bizarre ways in order for them to work. <br /> <br /> I'll start with an example from a group of mine that already has a disposition towards odd situations to begin with, seeing as they consist more or less of outcasts from their Pantheon who, one way or another, ended up not being exactly their parents favorite child, safe for the Isis-Scion maybe, who would jump off a cliff if mommy told him to. But thats beside the point, really. <br /> Still, they were entrusted with finding out more about a sect in Japan that seemingly practised an offshot of Onmyodo. Turns out not all of the stuff that got banned during the Meiji Restoration is dead and in fact Abe no Seimeis teaching were partially corrupted by Amatsu-Mikaboshi. Part of those teachings were revered by the sect &quot;Tsuchimikado no gakusha&quot; who worked from Tokyo. That much the gods knew. But how they worked or even organized themselves was left for the Scions to find out. <br /> <br /> I'll jump straight to the point, as this is, what the thread is about<b></b>: The whole thing was lead from a Cosplay-Caf\u00e9. And not just any Caf\u00e9, either. &quot;Vanilla Explosion&quot; was the hot joint these days with yummy food, cute girls and even a massage parlor. Also, rumors had it that the Seiyu of the equally new and hot Anime &quot;Gogyo no miko&quot; sometimes sang there. This Anime centers around a Magical Girl type of protagonist who unites the traditional five elements under her to blast evil.. all the good stuff. Some of the demons she fights, however, are oddly reminiscent of gods and that made the group wary. Rightfully so, as it turned out, for Tsuchimikados Scholars did not only write this Anime, they also cashed in on it and used sublimal advertising in it to recruit new members. <br /> <br /> And this is the story of how an Anime almost led to the downfall of the gods. Well, not really, but it provided a bit of strength and followers to Amatsu-Mikaboshi. The group of course disbanded the sect and the Anime got put on hold indefinitely. However, that commercial hole was quickly filled by an up-and-coming Band Sensation from Japan.. but thats another story. One that involves our Scion of Hachiman.<br /> <br /> Any similarly goofy stories you wanna share?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-25T17:52:05-08:00","id":792886,"title":"","content":"Uhhh, have you ever read mythology? The actions of these characters are extremely convoluted and obscene for any modern day logic.<br /> <br /> So yes, a game dealing with gods would more than likely include a &quot;stupid&quot; plot or two from time to time. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-26T01:09:33-08:00","id":793019,"title":"","content":"I studied cultural sciences, which doesn't go without a good deal of studying that stuff. In fact, my thesis has been about mythology. So I claim to know a fair deal about it. Juxtaposition is what I'm after. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-26T15:11:54-08:00","id":793283,"title":"","content":"You think that's silly, i should tell you sometime about the Ventrue cosplay idol or the &quot;Comiket Anarchs&quot; incident in my Masquerade games... <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> In Scion games a terrible one was a son of Zeus that, in a bout of Fate-induced unluck, would in a social event with a number of greek gods and their children come across Hera of all people and, to wiggle his way out of a most awkward (and potentially lethal) first meeting - and completely drawing a blank - started spouting broken shakespearean english and basically presented himself as comic book Thor, making him into something of the laughingstock of the occasion - and much to his chagrin, butt monkey of a bunch of smartass scions (of Hermes specially) that started using related comic references as slang and secret jargon among themselves, making sure the joke would never die.<br /> <br /> To compound his sufferings, not only was papa Zeus <b>not</b> amused with it, but Hera actually took a liking of the boy for the sensibility of actually trying to avoid the awkward truth. Unfortunately her way of showing favor apparently includes making him bodyguard/nanny for her daughter Hebe, goddess of youth, who as eternal teenager decided to go into a &quot;modernization romp&quot; he has the thankless job of watching out for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 12-26-2015, 06:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-27T08:03:02-08:00","id":793572,"title":"","content":"Okay, you got me beat there. This is hilarious. I might even stea... uhm, borrow that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T07:33:13-08:00","id":794170,"title":"","content":"Go for it and have fun with that. I have considered reworking the cosplay and con silliness into Scion games myself.<br /> <br /> My Scion games are peppered with quite silly bits amidst the drama and epic struggles, like a Scion of Hel that managed to get himself stalked by a group of goth/rocker girls believing him to be a vampire after his visitation and solved with Epic socials and Jotunblut, turning them into his harem of &quot;brides&quot;/berserker band, nicknamed Slayers by the other PCs, or the recurring adversary of a Cyclops always dressed in an eyesore of a tiger pimp coat he got from his Oni lover, or the group's main tank, a scion of Hephaestus that would get the band out of tight spots as many times by seducing some atrocious female titanspawn as by actual fighting. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 12-28-2015, 10:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T11:06:57-08:00","id":796914,"title":"","content":"A while ago I posted a plot idea in the story hooks that's essentially a high school, super hero game. The Scions weren't the most excited about finding out they were drafted into an apocalyptic war and are now have both Titanspawn and teenage problems to deal with. Kind of a sand box &quot;adventure of the week&quot; story like trying to prepare for midterms when a dragon falls out of the damn sky!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T12:37:52-08:00","id":796959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/792872-plain-stupid-plots?p=796914#post796914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A while ago I posted a plot idea in the story hooks that's essentially a high school, super hero game. The Scions weren't the most excited about finding out they were drafted into an apocalyptic war and are now have both Titanspawn and teenage problems to deal with. Kind of a sand box &quot;adventure of the week&quot; story like trying to prepare for midterms when a dragon falls out of the damn sky!</div> </div> </div> </div>So, sort of a Buffy/Percy Jackson kind of mash-up, eh?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T15:21:57-08:00","id":797040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/792872-plain-stupid-plots?p=796959#post796959\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So, sort of a Buffy/Percy Jackson kind of mash-up, eh?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That and early series Ultimate Spiderman. After all, the Scions are trying to keep a low profile so they don't get fate bound. And monsters keep showing up at their school, part time jobs, favorite hangout spots, or even their house!<br /> <br /> Fate decided that if they're not going to seek out the Titanspawn, then the Titanspawn are going to come to them!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 01-02-2016, 10:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T16:08:17-08:00","id":797063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/792872-plain-stupid-plots?p=797040#post797040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> That and early series Ultimate Spiderman. After all, the Scions are trying to keep a low profile so they don't get fate bound. And monsters keep showing up at their school, part time jobs favorite hangout spots, or even their house!<br /> <br /> Fate decided that if they're not going to seek out the Titanspawn, then the Titanspawn are going to come to them!</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it is sort of how Fateful aura is supposed to work, no? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> At least no one in the band came up with the &quot;tell a tale, one drink for every monster the big dude has boned&quot; game to mess with other Scions - Taoka kind of froze for a few seconds when cheered on and given a dose when mentioning Izanami - or a mock epic about &quot;The Twelve Lays of Hector&quot; and ever more ludricous female monsters he &quot;put to rest&quot;. And scandalously dishonest too (though about half of it was true), because he most certainly never slept with Loki, much less in mare form! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-31T03:25:11-08:00","id":797257,"title":"","content":"About the teenagers campaign, iirc on the old boards another user Deanshomshak(don't know if spelled correctly) ran a highshool scion game ewho was very successfull","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":